{"schema_version":1,"key":"p08-explicit-naming-request|skill|1","case_id":"p08-explicit-naming-request","type":"naming","condition":"skill","repetition":1,"status":"success","output":"1. 提案名：AI待ち時間埋め  \n   AIが考えている間に別の仕事を入れ、空き時間が消える状態。\n\n2. 提案名：AI思考中タスク差し込み  \n   AIが考えている時間へ別の仕事を差し込むことで、空き時間がなくなる状態。\n\n3. 提案名：AI待ち間消失  \n   AIの返答を待つ間に別の仕事を入れた結果、空き時間が消える状態。","usage":{"input_tokens":22066,"cached_input_tokens":12672,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":194,"reasoning_output_tokens":69},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T08:14:43.482Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T08:14:53.816Z","duration_ms":10334}
